Package: maxnet-os
Version: 0.4.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, curl, mpv, policykit-1, python3, xdg-utils, zenity
Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser | firefox
Maintainer: MaxOS contributors
Description: MaxNet-themed MaxOS desktop integration
 Eight MaxNet display themes for Cinnamon and GTK, startup theme selection,
 an update manager for checksum-verified GitHub releases, and app-menu
 launchers for MaxNet apps using the existing MaxNet service.
